id: assimilating-majin
name: Assimilating Majin
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Trait and never enforced (the user's).
requirement: Majin
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  With the unique ability to control your detached goop, you are able to absorb your enemies from a distance, turning your separated pieces of goo into dangerous weapons.
